From a3dfa5e6ead85193b401713b8d3e1b2e8cce6cc4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mkinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 21:45:07 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] fix(wire): add heal_tolerance for bounded 2D swallowtail
 offsets

Add `heal_tolerance` to `WireRuled` and validate it at the
`wire_contour_ruled` door. Pass `reach = k + heal_tolerance.max(COVER_TOL)`
to `laws::cover_healed` on both planes while keeping `laws::kerf` strict
at `PATH_TOL`. Emit an uncut-rest note when `COVER_TOL < d - k <=
heal_tolerance`, and refuse larger rest with spot, depth, and bound.

Fixes #2693
